&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a Senior Regional Revenue Operations Partner to serve as the operational and strategic leader for the regional revenue organization, spanning Sales, Customer Success, and Partnerships. This role is deeply embedded in the health and trajectory of the region, understanding where it is winning, where growth is being left on the table, and what operational gaps are standing between the team and its goals. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;As a full member of the regional senior leadership team, the Senior Regional Revenue Operations Partner owns the regional operational backlog—identifying, scoping, and prioritizing the investments needed to unlock performance—and partners with Central Revenue Operations and GTM to design and execute solutions. They serve as both a strategic translator (converting regional priorities into operational programs) and a critical feedback loop (surfacing the ground-level obstacles to growth back to global teams). When changes are rolled out from central Revenue Operations and GTM, this role ensures they land effectively in the region — driving adoption and closing the loop on what is and is not working.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Serve as the trusted advisor to Regional Rev Gen Leaders on revenue performance, growth strategy, and operational execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Participate in regional leadership meetings and contribute to strategic planning discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Translate corporate revenue objectives into regional operating plans and measurable execution frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Provide recommendations on market opportunities, resource allocation, and investment priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Define and own the operational framework and performance measurement standards for the region, serving as the definitive regional authority on revenue performance methodology. Proactively surface regional insights that inform and challenge global Revenue Operations strategy — not limited to local execution needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own weekly, monthly, quarterly, and annual forecasting processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Drive forecast accuracy and accountability across sales, partners and customer success leadership teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Identify risks, gaps, and upside opportunities within the pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Partner with Finance on budgeting, revenue planning, and annual operating plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Develop and manage KPA frameworks across the revenue funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Monitor pipeline generation, conversion rates, win rates, sales cycle velocity, attainment, expansion and churn trends for all channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Lead weekly business reviews with regional sales leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Deliver actionable recommendations to improve revenue productivity and execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Design and optimize territories, account segmentation, and coverage models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Partner with leadership to determine headcount requirements and productivity targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Conduct capacity modeling and scenario planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Evaluate territory performance and recommend adjustments based on market opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own and continuously evolve the regional analytics and reporting methodology; partner with Revenue Business Insights to translate that methodology into executive-level dashboards, ensuring standards are applied consistently across the region and shared with global teams as best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Conduct deep-dive analysis on performance drivers and business trends to uncover learnings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Deliver data-driven insights that influence strategic decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Establish standardized metrics and reporting governance across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Partner with GTM to inform GTM launches, accounting for regional nuance and mitigate friction across the sales process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to improve lead management, opportunity management, forecasting, and account planning workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Drive adoption of best practices across commercial teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Partner with Revenue Process and Tooling team to optimize CRM and GTM tooling for their region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Ensure data quality, governance, and process compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Evaluate and implement technologies that improve seller productivity and management visibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Support automation initiatives across reporting and operational workflows including field data hygiene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Revenue Operations and GTM to identify and build operational improvements and ensure new GTM motions land smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Influence senior stakeholders across multiple functions without direct authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Lead change management initiatives related to sales processes and operating models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, operational excellence, and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert and thought partner to central Revenue Operations on regional best practices, contributing to global frameworks, playbooks, and organizational capability building. Codify regional operational learnings, playbooks, and performance insights for broader adoption across the Revenue Operations function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;span id=&quot;gmail-docs-internal-guid-fbb990b5-7fff-4475-da19-478d67a198e0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10–12 years of experience in a B2B, SaaS, or technology environment, with progressive growth into a senior individual contributor role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Verbal and written fluency in English is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency in Spanish or Portuguese is considered an asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Commerce, Economics, or a related field highly valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Equivalent combination of education and/or work experience in related field may be substituted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in Revenue Operations, Sales Operations, Commercial Operations, Strategy, Consulting, FP&amp;amp;A, or related commercial functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting senior sales leadership within a B2B SaaS or technology environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering directly with Regional VPs, Area VPs, or General Managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Recognized subject matter expert in revenue operations with a track record of establishing standards, frameworks, or methodologies adopted beyond their immediate scope.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success influencing C-suite and VP-level stakeholders on strategic priorities without direct authority. Experience designing and scaling revenue operating models across multi-regional or enterprise environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to identify organizational capability gaps and lead the design of solutions that improve performance across the broader revenue generation function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven success managing forecasting, pipeline governance, and performance management programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of SaaS metrics and sales productivity drivers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced analytical and financial modeling capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with CRM and GTM systems, including Salesforce and modern revenue technology stacks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven executive-level communication and stakeholder management, including experience presenting complex revenue performance topics to C-suite and board-level audiences and translating findings into enterprise-level decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to travel 20–25% of the time. A valid passport is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
